{"nodes": [{"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_request_5", "label": "REQUEST 5 \u2014 the cap set behind \u00a710.2's 776 million pairs", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_mc_10", "label": "[MC-10] \u2014 mathematical accompaniment owed to Chapter 10 \u00a710.2", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The request exists because [MC-10] must raise L.voidfrac from COMPUTED to PROVED under verify-before-write, and cannot state the number without the population."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_l_voidfrac", "label": "L.voidfrac \u2014 compendium object, grade COMPUTED", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_void_free_fraction_claim", "label": "Void-free fraction 27.7\u201330.1% across 776 million pairs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_dependence_factor_149", "label": "Dependence factor 1.49 (joint 30.13% against product 20.19%)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_cap_set_unrecorded", "label": "The unrecorded cap set (capn, cape, cap\u2113, capk, capf)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The population is not recorded anywhere in the volumes, the Register, the figure caption or restore-pack A; hundreds of unrelated settings give ~776M pairs, so the cap set cannot be inferred and must be read from the instrument."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_pair_convention", "label": "Pair convention \u2014 ordered, unordered, or diagonal-inclusive", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The three conventions differ by ~2x and the recorded sum does not identify which was used."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_figure_10_1_plot_data", "label": "Figure 10.1 plot data \u2014 (cell count, void-free fraction) points", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_seventeenfold_hundredfold", "label": "Seventeenfold vs hundredfold discrepancy in Figure 10.1's range", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same measurement described two ways in the prose and the caption; to be settled from the data rather than editorially."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_box_containment_test", "label": "Box containment test hi_i \u2264 \u03c6(lo_j)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_conditional_lift_derivation", "label": "Tree-ordered conditional lifts \u2014 the derivation of the factor", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The factor equals the product of six tree-ordered conditional lifts (1.4081, equal to joint/product to four decimals); every lift above 1 sits on a shared-coordinate edge, each collapses to 1.0000 once conditioned on the shared coordinate's interval, so all dependence flows through shared coordinates; the sign is positive because the containment condition is a narrowness condition."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_population_mismatch_finding", "label": "Population mismatch \u2014 a finding about the reconstruction, not the record", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Standing rule: when a reconstruction disagrees with the record, the finding is about the reconstruction; nothing recorded is withdrawn."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_chat57_instruments", "label": "Chat-57 measurement instruments (lam8.py, mc10.py, mc10b/c/d.py)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REQUEST-5-voidfrac-caps.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_request_5_voidfrac_caps_register_locator_gap", "label": "Missing Register locator for the \u00a710.2 measuremen